# StormLens / PCP GeoCatalog — local config for the OFFICIAL Microsoft sample app.
# Fill in the two Entra values below, then `npm run dev` and open http://localhost:5173
#
# Your GeoCatalog endpoint (already set):
VITE_GEOCATALOG_URL=https://propoctwo.c4f6gxagdddtcpfa.westeurope.geocatalog.spatio.azure.com

# ⬇️ REQUIRED — create a Microsoft Entra "Single-page application (SPA)" app registration,
